	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With so few allies in the universe, those you have are more precious than all the wealth of the stars. Allies who Help you need only spend a bonus action to do so. In addition, if you are within 15ft of an ally who would be reduced to 0 HP, you can expend your reaction to move adjacent to your ally and take half the damage on their behalf. This reaction always leaves your ally with at least 1hp.</p>",
